## Security checklist (quick reference)

| Area | Recommendation |
|------|----------------|
| **Transport** | Serve the login page over HTTPS. Never send credentials in clear text. |
| **Brute‑force protection** | Add rate‑limiting (e.g., lock the account after N failed attempts, or use a CAPTCHA). |
