│
├─ app.js                ← main server file (see section 2)
├─ auth-middleware.js    ← remember‑me middleware (section 3)
└─ db.js                 ← your data‑access layer (must export:
                         │   - getUserById(id)
                         │   - authenticate(email, password)
                         │   - (optional) saveRememberMeToken(...)
