| **`LIKE ?` with `%` wildcards** | Gives a simple “contains” search on `name` and `description`. |
| **`LIMIT … OFFSET …`** | Efficient pagination – only the needed rows are sent from MySQL. |
| **Error logging** | Keeps the UI clean while you can still debug in your logs. |

